{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021122205367-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021131940\"/><p>事發在永星里1B號大廈一間賓館。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>今午(21日)12時12分，油麻地永星里1B號大廈一間賓館，職員發現租客未有按時退房，遂以後備門匙開門查看，揭發該名年約40歲男子昏迷在內，遂報案求助。救援人員接報到場，當場證實事主已經死亡，人員正就事件展開調查，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:39:39.302696+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:22:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T05:37:43.709475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:37:43.709475+00:00","content_hash":"4b7abaaff1361f72ed2a77c401feafa99591eee9137296e5708b48f5c5d2a437","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}